{
 "comment": "Category rules for tools/patch_library/index.py (docs/plans/patch-library.md, Categories). folders: a source's own folder names (lower case) that declare a category; a folder not listed declares nothing. keywords: regular expressions matched on the patch name, case-insensitive; a name matching one category gets it at confidence 0.9, two or more at 0.6 (the first listed wins). banks: the same keywords tried on the bank name when the name gives nothing and the bank names one kind of sound only (not 'Brass + Synths'; confidence 0.7).",
